<title>HONG KONG: Guangnan 1996 profit rises 85.51 pct.</title>
<headline>Guangnan 1996 profit rises 85.51 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   38.0     vs 24.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    8.13     vs 5.50</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    217.20   vs 117.08</p>
<p>    Turnover		     5,705.45 vs 3,965.91</p>
<p>    Company name		 Guangnan (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 13-19</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 10</p>
<p>NOTE - Food distributor Guangnan (Holdings) is a unit of Guangdong province's Guangdong Enterprises Group.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 12.03 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 3.90 cents) vs 8.5 cent.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
